        "created_at": "2015-09-28T19:41:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1. Can you place presence on lands with blight? I know blight destroys one preexisting presence per player, but does it also stop Spirits from placing presence on that land?</p><p>2. Do I have to do all parts of a Spirit's growth option? For example, if I am playing Vital Strength of the Earth, and I choose to reclaim my power cards, do I have to add a presence to the board (if I have any left), or can I choose to just reclaim the cards?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:33.690Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
