        "raw": "<p>1. Can you place presence on lands with blight? I know blight destroys one preexisting presence per player, but does it also stop Spirits from placing presence on that land?</p><p>2. Do I have to do all parts of a Spirit&#39;s growth option? For example, if I am playing Vital Strength of the Earth, and I choose to reclaim my power cards, do I have to add a presence to the board (if I have any left), or can I choose to just reclaim the cards?</p>",
