        "id": 149023,
        "name": "grysqrl",
        "username": "grysqrl",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/grysqrl/{size}/1909_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-09-28T19:51:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1) You can totally place presence in lands with blight.</p><p>2) I can't think of a reason that you wouldn't want to take all of the actions available to you. At some point the rule was that you do everything in the box in order from left to right. I think we may have dropped the \"in order\" part at some point, but the question really hasn't come up in my games. Do you have an example of not wanting to use all of the growth actions?</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:27:24.310Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 1,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 5.2,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 13681,
