        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>1) You can totally place presence in lands with blight.</p><p>2) I can&#39;t think of a reason that you wouldn&#39;t want to take all of the actions available to you. At some point the rule was that you do everything in the box in order from left to right. I think we may have dropped the &quot;in order&quot; part at some point, but the question really hasn&#39;t come up in my games. Do you have an example of not wanting to use all of the growth actions?</p>",
