        "raw": "<p>I had a rather long game with Vital Strength of the Earth, but I got to a point where I finally managed to get the board under control. I didn&#39;t want to place my last two presence until I needed them, as the VSE sacred sites are so useful as forts.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Does that make sense? Basically, I didn&#39;t want to put them in spot A, only to realize two turns later they would have been more usefull in spot B.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I agree that you almost always want to place presence on the board, but just having the option to hold off would be nice.</p>",
