        "created_at": "2015-09-28T20:33:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, I don't remember if this is printed anywhere in the rules, but if you want to place presence and don't have any more on your spirit panel, you can remove a presence from the island and place that one instead (effectively moving one that's already on the board).</p>",
