      {
        "id": 149028,
        "name": "Eric R",
        "username": "Eric_R",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-09-29T00:29:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>You are definitely required to do everything in the Growth box, but&nbsp;</span><span>grysqrl is correct - you can move Presence already on the board. (I think there's a \"Moving Presence\" sidebar next to the section on Presence on the page with the spirit panel? If not, there should have been.) This mostly crops up when a Spirit has all the Presence on the board that they're legally allowed to place, but might in theory be relevant at other times.</span></p><blockquote><p><span>At some point the rule was that you do everything in the box in order from left to right. I think we may have dropped the \"in order\" part at some point, but the question really hasn't come up in my games</span></p></blockquote><p>That was dropped for the sake of simplicity - especially since the options were nearly always in the order you'd want to do them anyhow.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:27:24.633Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
