        "raw": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">You are definitely required to do everything in the Growth box, but&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">grysqrl is correct - you can move Presence already on the board. (I think there&#39;s a &quot;Moving Presence&quot; sidebar next to the section on Presence on the page with the spirit panel? If not, there should have been.) This mostly crops up when a Spirit has all the Presence on the board that they&#39;re legally allowed to place, but might in theory be relevant at other times.</span></p><blockquote><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21.6000003814697px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">At some point the rule was that you do everything in the box in order from left to right. I think we may have dropped the &quot;in order&quot; part at some point, but the question really hasn&#39;t come up in my games</span></p></blockquote><p>That was dropped for the sake of simplicity - especially since the options were nearly always in the order you&#39;d want to do them anyhow.</p>",
