        "created_at": "2015-09-29T00:48:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Eric R\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Eric R:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think there's a \"Moving Presence\" sidebar next to the section on Presence on the page with the spirit panel? If not, there should have been.)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ya, you're right. It is in the Sprits section, right below the Presence section, I wasn't looking low enough. Thank you!</p>",
